SURFACE (parity with the web source — no scope narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native files (allowed scope: apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/BatteryHealthAnalyticsWidget.*):
  BatteryHealthAnalyticsWidget.swift          — SwiftUI surface: header + loading/empty/error/content
  BatteryHealthAnalyticsWidget.Model.swift    — P1/S8 state-holder seam, DTO, @Observable model, P1/S11
                                                telemetry seam (`view.opened`), registry, P1/S10 facade
